#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237996 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0af8caaa-29c4-5c99-9449-130f1bf46247" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡y=-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235870} {:answer/id #uuid "2215e267-9632-5f7b-94e1-e9178e43c21a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}^{3}{y}^{2}-3{x}^{2}{y}^{2}=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236036} {:answer/id #uuid "4eb6b3cc-1d28-5f8e-88f3-7196d397ce82" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{x}^{2}{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y-\\operatorname{cos}⁡y=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236322} {:answer/id #uuid "4ede51de-f0d9-578c-b425-22eaa3f631c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡y=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236323} {:answer/id #uuid "ef05ec46-9abc-5f4f-aea2-e3b2381aae79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}^{3}{y}^{2}-3{x}^{2}{y}^{2}=-y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237324}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4ede51de-f0d9-578c-b425-22eaa3f631c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡y=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236323} :answer-field/id #uuid "3e48f0b0-e7c2-50f6-b9f0-fd01ed94e3fa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237520}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "36e57149-6157-5e92-960f-5ad130bb2d0e" :question/math-academy-id "q-103339" :question/problem "Find the general solution of the exact differential equation\n\n$$\n(3{y}^{2}-6{x}^{2}y)\\,\\text{d}x+(6xy-2{x}^{3}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡y)\\text{d}y=0\n$$\n\nwith the initial condition $y(1)=0.$" :question/worked-solution "Note that the differential equation is of the form\n\n$$\nP(x,y)\\text{d}x+Q(x,y)\\text{d}y=0\n$$\n\nwhere $P(x,y)=3{y}^{2}-6{x}^{2}y$ and $Q(x,y)=6xy-2{x}^{3}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡y.$\n\nSince the equation is exact, our solution $u(x,y)$ must satisfy the following system:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂u}{∂x}=P(x,y),\\,\\frac{∂u}{∂y}=Q(x,y)\n$$\n\nFirst, we integrate $P(x,y)$ with respect to $x.$ Note that the solution should contain an arbitrary function of $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(x,y) & =\\int P(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+f(y) \\\\  & =\\int (3{y}^{2}-6{x}^{2}y)\\,\\text{d}x+f(y) \\\\  & =3x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y+f(y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we integrate $Q(x,y)$ with respect to $y.$  Note that the solution should contain an arbitrary function of $x.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(x,y) & =\\int Q(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+g(x) \\\\  & =\\int (6xy-2{x}^{3}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡y)\\,\\text{d}y+g(x) \\\\  & =3x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+g(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComparing the two solutions, we see that we must have\n\n$$\ng(x)=0,\\,f(y)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution $u(x,y)=c$ is\n\n$$\n3x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡y=c.\n$$\n\nThe particular solution specified by the initial condition must have $y=0$ when $x=1.$ These values determine the value of the constant $c.$ Substituting this into the equation gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡y=c \\\\ 3\\cdot (1)\\cdot (0)^{2}-2\\cdot (1)^{3}\\cdot (0)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡0=c \\\\ 0+0+1=c \\\\ c=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n3x{y}^{2}-2{x}^{3}y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡y=1.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237997 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06546274-02e5-5fc0-8fae-4f46fc931bd1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x=c" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235841} {:answer/id #uuid "0b8f1609-767c-5a5f-911b-16174449c210" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)=c" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235877} {:answer/id #uuid "4c89f096-4fb6-5556-9833-c93820386b55" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)=c" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236303} {:answer/id #uuid "b65d8303-f8ca-518f-8242-e51a024da3b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "xy\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)=c" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236971} {:answer/id #uuid "c0176ae2-6815-557e-8201-2d38ac9d6469" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡y=c" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237039}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4c89f096-4fb6-5556-9833-c93820386b55" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)=c" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236303} :answer-field/id #uuid "9d1c0326-b97a-59e1-9914-e218c73cd1fd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237649}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "2b34dbbc-c99b-5448-a113-40f6cf7c0d24" :question/math-academy-id "q-103341" :question/problem "Find the general solution of the exact differential equation\n\n$$\n(y\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\frac{1}{x})\\text{d}x+(x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\frac{1}{y})\\text{d}y=0.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Note that the differential equation is of the form\n\n$$\nP(x,y)\\text{d}x+Q(x,y)\\text{d}y=0\n$$\n\nwhere $P(x,y)=y\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\frac{1}{x}$ and $Q(x,y)=x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\frac{1}{y}.$\n\nSince the equation is exact, our solution $u(x,y)$ must satisfy the following system:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂u}{∂x}=P(x,y),\\,\\frac{∂u}{∂y}=Q(x,y)\n$$\n\nFirst, we integrate $P(x,y)$ with respect to $x.$ Note that the solution should contain an arbitrary function of $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(x,y) & =\\int P(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+f(y) \\\\  & =\\int (y\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\frac{1}{x})\\text{d}x+f(y) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+f(y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we integrate $Q(x,y)$ with respect to $y.$  Note that the solution should contain an arbitrary function of $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(x,y) & =\\int Q(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+g(x) \\\\  & =\\int (x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\frac{1}{y})\\text{d}y+g(x) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡y+g(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComparing the two solutions, we see that we must have\n\n$$\ng(x)=-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x,\\,f(y)=-\\operatorname{ln}⁡y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution $u(x,y)=c$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =c \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy) & =c.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240845 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20897b11-31f3-5236-8344-066364ab30aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{e}^{x}cos⁡x-{e}^{x}sin⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238339} {:answer/id #uuid "2e9dc0f2-2211-5b4e-a2e7-26a81ec7f21c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}cos⁡x+sin⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238465} {:answer/id #uuid "528c811e-a747-5b55-b5c7-a2d707220097" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}cos⁡x-{e}^{x}sin⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238765} {:answer/id #uuid "c9cd3281-ae65-5560-8442-2a603e50ff12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{e}^{x}cos⁡x+sin⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239827} {:answer/id #uuid "cce47b31-03c3-57e4-ae08-02ac34ba2a0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}cos⁡x+{e}^{x}sin⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239848}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "528c811e-a747-5b55-b5c7-a2d707220097" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x}cos⁡x-{e}^{x}sin⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238765} :answer-field/id #uuid "fe0d6216-93d3-5d7b-aefb-cbdf2e8a0a46" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240776}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "6d7240cf-a773-5ae8-8c7e-03955317789e" :question/math-academy-id "q-104297" :question/problem "Differentiate ${e}^{x}cos⁡x.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)={e}^{x}$ and $v(x)=cos⁡x.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({e}^{x}cos⁡x)^{′} & ={u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =({e}^{x})^{′}\\cdot cos⁡x+{e}^{x}\\cdot (cos⁡x)^{′} \\\\  & =({e}^{x})(cos⁡x)+({e}^{x})(-sin⁡x) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}cos⁡x-{e}^{x}sin⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244112 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "089d503b-4f24-5763-9960-5ba89a429460" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241256} {:answer/id #uuid "1e118c0a-4e95-58e5-a976-91027b338e8e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-34" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241438} {:answer/id #uuid "7326fac1-3a0a-542f-ada6-d08f1f8e9903" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "43" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242201} {:answer/id #uuid "8d44a50b-e600-5db0-a6a5-f5e4f444fa6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242426} {:answer/id #uuid "b626af1e-b5fa-55ea-8216-0d91300e2897" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "37" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242774}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7326fac1-3a0a-542f-ada6-d08f1f8e9903" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "43" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242201} :answer-field/id #uuid "451243fc-f02f-57e6-b84d-3ae575f2644f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243569}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "63888dba-48b5-5525-9ea0-6080e9970645" :question/math-academy-id "q-1080" :question/problem "Calculate $\\text{det}(X)$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle X=\\begin{bmatrix}10 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(X) & =\\begin{vmatrix}10 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =10\\cdot 4-(-3)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =40-(-3) \\\\  & =43\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244117 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "098d3c16-b771-5cb2-8ca3-8e05e6e12a5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241263} {:answer/id #uuid "409c02b9-d9b4-55b4-bf81-e98091b0492b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241757} {:answer/id #uuid "53b66e4c-123c-5d65-a013-eb5273d4b910" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6x-{y}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241929} {:answer/id #uuid "62f7f512-fffc-58a3-bb47-dd0d46209f22" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6x-{y}^{2}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242069} {:answer/id #uuid "637034ca-7cd9-52c8-ad26-49ffc9798d80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6x-{y}^{2}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242077}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "637034ca-7cd9-52c8-ad26-49ffc9798d80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6x-{y}^{2}z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242077} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b2eb4c8-aa05-5d06-93d8-a00bf06218cb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243459}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "04f24cee-9b4e-520b-8022-59737dad510a" :question/math-academy-id "q-1083" :question/problem "$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{vmatrix}2x & {y}^{2} \\\\ z & -3\\end{vmatrix}=\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}2x & {y}^{2} \\\\ z & -3\\end{vmatrix} & =2x\\cdot (-3)-{y}^{2}\\cdot z \\\\  & =-6x-{y}^{2}z\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244154 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "03b3c5a5-7375-5461-b9f0-c802ef651773" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241212} {:answer/id #uuid "2f76bb9d-e6c7-5e1a-b8a2-67876cf68b7e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241604} {:answer/id #uuid "78aac119-4dde-5951-ad35-559a566ff943" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242243} {:answer/id #uuid "a223bb82-bec3-501b-aded-253a53009b2f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242600} {:answer/id #uuid "c3968252-fc1a-5b53-9617-261d78f533e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242897}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a223bb82-bec3-501b-aded-253a53009b2f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242600} :answer-field/id #uuid "cf01c73d-57cf-5598-8656-0c2a923068f4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243800}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "2c5d0d5a-1c35-5e42-acae-01a474314ae5" :question/math-academy-id "q-1087" :question/problem "Calculate $det(T)$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle T=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & 17 \\\\ 1 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(T) & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} & 17 \\\\ 1 & 10\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 10-17\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =5-17 \\\\  & =-12\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250122 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0609bfa0-feaa-5eb6-8746-b749fc1e9ec2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\,{e}^{x-1}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247477} {:answer/id #uuid "253a16d7-628b-53f9-a7b2-1f6c746a4abb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\,{e}^{x/2\\,-\\,1}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247750} {:answer/id #uuid "2d6d85b6-5dd0-5f4b-aa63-52da5bb8cf45" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\,{e}^{x/2\\,-\\,1}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247828} {:answer/id #uuid "3bc85c63-a410-59bf-afe3-e5c1937a752b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{x/2\\,-\\,1}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247953} {:answer/id #uuid "42a6cbcd-5218-511c-8178-7959687c4db1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{x/2\\,-\\,1}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248018}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2d6d85b6-5dd0-5f4b-aa63-52da5bb8cf45" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\,{e}^{x/2\\,-\\,1}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247828} :answer-field/id #uuid "4c624ee9-f981-5550-b705-79dced8e3486" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249811}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "0dd276ae-ab9b-5d13-9781-196a361b49ac" :question/math-academy-id "q-113833" :question/problem "Calculate $$\n\\displaystyle \\int {e}^{x/2\\,-\\,1}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=\\frac{x}{2}-1,$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,2\\,\\text{d}u=\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThen, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {e}^{x/2\\,-\\,1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{u}\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\int {e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\,{e}^{u}+C \\\\  & =2\\,{e}^{x/2\\,-\\,1}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250124 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c4d74b89-75a1-56f3-b6b6-828088510585" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}+\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}+\\frac{1}{x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249171} {:answer/id #uuid "de570091-257b-5378-a03a-2502b905ef6b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{3}}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249396} {:answer/id #uuid "e77f388d-8a73-59ce-8f66-bc9a394fa477" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{4}}}+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{1}{x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249466} {:answer/id #uuid "f18e54e2-bbf7-5c09-a529-02ac0e448d1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}}{3}+4{x}^{4}+\\frac{x}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249545} {:answer/id #uuid "f8f381b4-0b8f-5cfb-8192-5f7af284e5dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{x}+\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}-\\frac{x}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249595}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c4d74b89-75a1-56f3-b6b6-828088510585" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}+\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}+\\frac{1}{x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249171} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb1b4399-41fb-5b60-b839-8a80147e6a2e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249996}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "e132caee-594d-5f81-b6a1-2e2a44a2d5f6" :question/math-academy-id "q-113848" :question/problem "Find the antiderivative of \n$$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{4}}}+{x}^{3}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{4}}}+{x}^{3}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}})\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {x}^{-4/3}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int {x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x-\\int {x}^{-2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{-4/3+1}}{(-\\frac{4}{3}+1)}+\\frac{{x}^{3+1}}{(3+1)}-\\frac{{x}^{-2+1}}{(-2+1)}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{-1/3}}{\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)}+\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}-\\frac{{x}^{-1}}{(-1)}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}+\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}+\\frac{1}{x}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250134 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "271c490c-5a05-5e0a-9c8e-cee6e93cd8b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{6}cos⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247771} {:answer/id #uuid "39e2cf43-8568-5bca-98a7-54e900afc4d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6cos⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247936} {:answer/id #uuid "8369302d-e75e-5f17-a44e-47eda2ef57fa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6sin⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248585} {:answer/id #uuid "8f10e1a5-527b-5f97-860b-39eca916d8f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6sin⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248696} {:answer/id #uuid "a8b91066-0304-5eec-9198-3b7d46a0b0c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6cos⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248923}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39e2cf43-8568-5bca-98a7-54e900afc4d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6cos⁡\\theta +C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247936} :answer-field/id #uuid "d679155c-4e3c-59a8-a851-7bdacacd637d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250043}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "4099e9a0-92e6-5376-9bf3-b36d248db1d1" :question/math-academy-id "q-113907" :question/problem "$$\n\\displaystyle \\int (-6sin⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}\\theta =\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int sin⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =-cos⁡\\theta +C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int (-6sin⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}\\theta  & =-6\\int sin⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =-6(-cos⁡\\theta )+C \\\\  & =6cos⁡\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250135 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e110585-148d-5b73-8c52-9b80a228a906" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}sin⁡y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247973} {:answer/id #uuid "44cfbe88-2a28-57ed-af22-7a46cf6cebff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}sin⁡y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248040} {:answer/id #uuid "48228916-ab6f-548c-a9e8-682af00b3143" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5cos⁡y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248069} {:answer/id #uuid "54690fdf-f2bf-58c6-8959-b1212dbd668c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5sin⁡y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248183} {:answer/id #uuid "9537f444-1492-5ebc-9220-1ba17b75bed1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5cos⁡y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248750}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "54690fdf-f2bf-58c6-8959-b1212dbd668c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5sin⁡y+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248183} :answer-field/id #uuid "3b943c43-477a-5079-9de3-d33c94e57c4a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249775}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "51e2c13f-c606-5d86-a345-77ece48f02ef" :question/math-academy-id "q-113908" :question/problem "$$\n\\displaystyle \\int 5cos⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int cos⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=sin⁡y+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int 5cos⁡y\\,\\text{d}y & =5\\int cos⁡y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =5(sin⁡y)+C \\\\  & =5sin⁡y+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250136 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e7aeb20-aa4f-5c00-b50e-3e615f4643cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2sin⁡x-3cos⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247558} {:answer/id #uuid "62df88aa-b76b-5e6c-8946-00778e964b10" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2sin⁡x+3cos⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248318} {:answer/id #uuid "b216bcb4-4c32-5718-a540-c7d82cf23f47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2cos⁡x-3sin⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249020} {:answer/id #uuid "f0a806cb-d622-5d7d-9f4d-8e6b00b51a8a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3cos⁡x-2sin⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249539} {:answer/id #uuid "f92773f0-dcf3-5dfd-bb38-756d45a3c3c0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3sin⁡x-2cos⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249596}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e7aeb20-aa4f-5c00-b50e-3e615f4643cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2sin⁡x-3cos⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247558} :answer-field/id #uuid "2a529799-bd2f-5a0c-b827-31403c948ec2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249751}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "024b6258-39f4-52fd-a000-550a30db6b19" :question/math-academy-id "q-113909" :question/problem "$$\n\\displaystyle \\int (2cos⁡x+3sin⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int sin⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-cos⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int cos⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =sin⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (2cos⁡x+3sin⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\int cos⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+3\\int sin⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2sin⁡x+3(-cos⁡x)+C \\\\  & =2sin⁡x-3cos⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250138 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a6b2d77-6333-57e0-afd5-ae25cfed1172" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3sec⁡xcot⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247800} {:answer/id #uuid "558aa8a6-6ebf-5d3f-a5a9-3b19d8e488c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3csc⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248195} {:answer/id #uuid "73fffa3b-03d4-5a40-b567-70c7ae4ccf96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3csc⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248445} {:answer/id #uuid "a4b2a2ae-e079-58a1-a369-536f12c56dbc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3sec⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248893} {:answer/id #uuid "acbcb4c2-9b18-5aa7-84c2-3dabda9f77dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3sec⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248966}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "73fffa3b-03d4-5a40-b567-70c7ae4ccf96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3csc⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248445} :answer-field/id #uuid "c3fad684-5e9d-51a7-9e19-ea6cfd103f16" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250006}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "0ba0c93b-e27b-584f-9b8e-5ad2b653f757" :question/math-academy-id "q-113920" :question/problem "$$\n\\displaystyle \\int -3csc⁡x\\,cot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$